First, the foundation: the identity graph

Everything TruAudience sells sits on one thing — a single identity graph that acts as the backbone for an interoperable suite of identity-driven marketing products, using AI to cluster identifiers into individuals and households and then score how confident it is in each match. 
GlobeNewswire

Plain terms: a giant map that says "this email, this phone number, this home address, this streaming device and this cookie are all the same person — and here's how sure we are."

Everything below is either feeding that map, using it, or measuring results through it.


