5. Credit-Informed Marketing — the one nobody else has

Improves campaign performance with credit-informed data targeting solutions. 
TransUnion

Plain terms: Using regulated credit-bureau signals to target people likely to qualify and convert — not just people who look interested.
Example: A card issuer only mails prefiltered prospects who'd actually pass underwriting. Cuts wasted spend and declines dramatically.
This is heavily regulated (in the US, FCRA rules around prescreen and permissible purpose) — which is precisely why competitors can't copy it.

How it all connects

The suite is designed as a loop:

Identity cleans your data → Audiences turns it into targets → media runs → Analytics measures what worked → results feed back into who you target next. TruAudience connects your data, teams and marketing platforms with a single identity graph. 
TransUnion

That closed loop is the actual product. Buying just the MMM piece from TransUnion gets you a good-but-not-best-in-class model; buying the loop is where the value case sits.
